\ === Shed ===

\ a garden tool hanging on a wall facing north: its handle and a head of the given shape
: hanging-tool ( x top length head z -- )
	| x top length head z |
	0.45 pen!
	x top z x top length - z edge
	top length - to foot
	0.7 pen!
	head :spade = if [ [ x 0.09 - foot z ] [ x 0.09 + foot z ] [ x 0.07 + foot 0.24 - z ] [ x 0.07 - foot 0.24 - z ] ] outline then
	head :rake = if
		x 0.2 - foot z x 0.2 + foot z edge
		0 7 1 do k k 6 / 0.4 * 0.2 - x + to tine tine foot z tine foot 0.08 - z edge loop
	then
	head :hoe = if x foot z x 0.14 + foot 0.08 - z edge then
	head :saw = if [ [ x 0.03 - foot z ] [ x 0.1 + foot z ] [ x 0.06 + foot 0.42 - z ] [ x 0.03 - foot 0.42 - z ] ] outline then ;

